==Battleground==
*3 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 2~3 seconds<sup>60f~90f</sup>.
*3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Box Witch and Minions]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**2 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
**3 [[Rain D.|Rain Ds]] spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
**1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns.
**5 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**1 [[Gabriel]] spawns.
**2 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

